# Other organizations' logos for the Experience section (claims register rows E1-E6). This
# repository is public, so no logo is committed without the mark owner's written permission:
# the files the owner supplied stay in local or private storage only. Commit a logo in the same
# change that sets its entry's `logoApproved: true`, by adding an exception line below, e.g.
# !src/assets/engagements/<file>.png
src/assets/engagements/*
